<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
    <title><%= title %></title>
    <link href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        * { margin:0; padding:0; box-sizing:border-box; font-family:'Inter',sans-serif; }
        body {
            min-height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0f172a 0%, #1e293b 100%);
            color: white;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 2rem;
        }
        .maintenance-box {
            max-width: 520px;
        }
        .icon-wrap {
            width: 100px;
            height: 100px;
            background: rgba(251,191,36,0.15);
            border-radius: 50%;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            margin: 0 auto 2rem;
            animation: pulse 2s infinite;
        }
        .icon-wrap i { font-size: 2.8rem; color: #fbbf24; }
        @keyframes pulse {
            0%,100% { box-shadow: 0 0 0 0 rgba(251,191,36,0.3); }
            50% { box-shadow: 0 0 0 20px rgba(251,191,36,0); }
        }
        h1 { font-size: 2rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
        p { color: #94a3b8; font-size: 1.05rem; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; }
        .badge-maintenance {
            display: inline-block;
            background: rgba(251,191,36,0.2);
            color: #fbbf24;
            border: 1px solid rgba(251,191,36,0.4);
            padding: 0.4rem 1.2rem;
            border-radius: 50px;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            letter-spacing: 0.05em;
        }
        .progress-bar-wrap {
            background: rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
            border-radius: 50px;
            height: 6px;
            margin: 2rem auto;
            max-width: 300px;
            overflow: hidden;
        }
        .progress-bar-inner {
            height: 100%;
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, #fbbf24, #f59e0b);
            border-radius: 50px;
            animation: loading 2.5s ease-in-out infinite;
        }
        @keyframes loading {
            0% { width: 10%; }
            50% { width: 80%; }
            100% { width: 10%; }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="maintenance-box">
        <div class="icon-wrap">
            <i class="fas fa-tools"></i>
        </div>
        <span class="badge-maintenance"><i class="fas fa-wrench mr-1"></i> MAINTENANCE MODE</span>
        <h1 style="margin-top:1.5rem;">Website Sedang Diperbaiki</h1>
        <p>Kami sedang melakukan pemeliharaan dan peningkatan sistem. Website akan segera kembali online. Mohon maaf atas ketidaknyamanannya.</p>
        <div class="progress-bar-wrap">
            <div class="progress-bar-inner"></div>
        </div>
        <p style="font-size:0.85rem;color:#64748b;">Silakan kembali beberapa saat lagi.</p>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
